{"vid":"zZDDIpnbm1s","source":"zZDDIpnbm1s.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":9.5,"txt":"hey welcome to the shop today we're"},{"t":10.9,"txt":"going to do some welding with 7014"},{"t":12.7,"txt":"that's a rod that you haven't really"},{"t":13.8,"txt":"seen on the channel here before but i've"},{"t":15.5,"txt":"received over 100 comments from people"},{"t":17.6,"txt":"who swear by this electrode so i figured"},{"t":20.3,"txt":"i'd give it a try i'll tell you right"},{"t":21.8,"txt":"now i really liked it is it going to"},{"t":23.3,"txt":"become my new favorite rod i don't know"},{"t":25.2,"txt":"let's see"},{"t":26.4,"txt":"so the first thing we want to look at is"},{"t":28,"txt":"how easy is it to strike an arc not just"},{"t":30.2,"txt":"the first time but multiple times with"},{"t":32.3,"txt":"the electrode so we're going to use one"},{"t":34.2,"txt":"of the exercises that i have in each of"},{"t":36.2,"txt":"my online courses where we put a number"},{"t":38.7,"txt":"of tack welds along a lap joint the"},{"t":40.8,"txt":"electrode size i'm using is 3 32 of an"},{"t":43.1,"txt":"inch and i'll turn my machine to 75 amps"},{"t":45.5,"txt":"to get started that's at the low end of"},{"t":47.2,"txt":"the range for this electrode"},{"t":49,"txt":"so i have put an attack weld and then"},{"t":52,"txt":"another one"},{"t":53.3,"txt":"and i'll just keep going all the way"},{"t":55.6,"txt":"along this plate to see how that goes"},{"t":58.8,"txt":"relative to other rods and i'll tell you"},{"t":60.5,"txt":"right now it's really easy to strike an"},{"t":62.8,"txt":"arc with this electrode compared to"},{"t":64.5,"txt":"others"},{"t":65.6,"txt":"though you still need to have the skill"},{"t":67,"txt":"necessary to do it one thing i did"},{"t":69,"txt":"notice is that the electrode does burn"},{"t":71.2,"txt":"back into the flux that's pretty similar"},{"t":73.3,"txt":"to a 7018 but one thing that you don't"},{"t":76.2,"txt":"get at least i didn't get in the whole"},{"t":7