 to turn"},{"t":150.6,"txt":"the machine up to 80 amps to run a"},{"t":152.4,"txt":"t-joint with that same 3 32 of an inch"},{"t":155,"txt":"electrode on one eighth inch thick"},{"t":157.4,"txt":"plates it's welding along really"},{"t":159.8,"txt":"smoothly just like before and"},{"t":161.6,"txt":"everything's filling in and i can see"},{"t":164.2,"txt":"where the slag is following behind my"},{"t":167.2,"txt":"weld puddle that brighter area is the"},{"t":169,"txt":"weld puddle and you can see that slag"},{"t":171.1,"txt":"just falling with a c shape right behind"},{"t":173.3,"txt":"covering over things which means it's"},{"t":175.2,"txt":"not mixing in which is a problem that"},{"t":176.8,"txt":"you get a lot with 6013 definitely seems"},{"t":179.7,"txt":"to be easier to keep those two separate"},{"t":182.1,"txt":"with a 70 14. big thumbs up on that"},{"t":185.6,"txt":"so afterwards once again it did take a"},{"t":188.2,"txt":"little bit of chipping to get the slag"},{"t":189.9,"txt":"off but brushing it off i came out with"},{"t":192.7,"txt":"something that uh seems to be good"},{"t":194.6,"txt":"enough now let's try welding a little"},{"t":196.1,"txt":"bit thicker material i've turned the"},{"t":197.6,"txt":"amperage up here to 90. the range on"},{"t":200.8,"txt":"this electrode is clear up over 100"},{"t":203,"txt":"which is pretty typical for a 330"},{"t":204.9,"txt":"seconds of an inch electrode of any type"},{"t":207,"txt":"that has some iron powder in the flux"},{"t":209.3,"txt":"coating as well i'm welding on some 3 16"},{"t":212.6,"txt":"inch thick material here and it's laying"},{"t":215.8,"txt":"in pretty nicely once again i can see it"},{"t":218.1,"txt":"really penetrating down into the"},{"t":219.8,"txt":"material once again no rod manipulation"},{"t":222.7,"txt":"i'm just running a smooth stringer bead"},{"t":224.8,"txt":"right in there and after chipping and"},{"t":227,"txt":"brushing that off it came out pretty"},{"t":229.1,"txt":"smooth once again 